OL,4,CThree Kyiv bridges hit during major    
OL,5,CRussian missile attack                 
OL,6,GRussia has targeted bridges in Kyiv    
OL,7,Gand killed eight during one of the     
OL,8,Glargest air attacks of the war so far, 
OL,9,Gdays after Ukraine inflicted heavy     
OL,10,Gdamage on the strategically important  
OL,11,GCrimean Bridge.                        
OL,13,FTwo people were killed in Russian      
OL,14,Fstrikes on a railway station in the    
OL,15,Fwestern city of Lviv.                  
OL,17,FBallistic missiles hit three bridges   
OL,18,Fover the Dnipro River, vital routes    
OL,19,Fwhich people in Kyiv rely on to move   
OL,20,Faround the city, with six deaths       
OL,21,Fconfirmed in the capital.              
